WEBVTT

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:01.860
Number four: We're big picture people.

00:07:02.451 --> 00:07:04.581
Do you know how big China is?

00:07:05.699 --> 00:07:08.813
It's around the same size as the States.

00:07:09.329 --> 00:07:11.600
But we all know that
there are four time zones

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:14.221
across the contiguous United States.

00:07:14.721 --> 00:07:17.731
In China, we've got one.

00:07:18.241 --> 00:07:22.162
In China, everything is perceived as one.

00:07:22.732 --> 00:07:24.121
One time zone,

00:07:24.121 --> 00:07:25.560
one official language,

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:26.731
one party,

00:07:26.731 --> 00:07:29.597
despite diverse ethnicities and cultures.